Extend Dermux keybar with HJSON config, gestures and runtime reload.

This patch introduces:
1. `hjson` dependency for strict config parsing.
2. Config model validation and rendering from two-row layout.
3. Tap/up/down gesture routing with swipe thresholds.
4. Runtime config reload command and workspace file watch (`.dermux-keybar.hjson`).
5. Action dispatch (`command|key|text|noop`).

